= Russia Annexes Crimea

Russian forces have seized Crimea, and Moscow annexes the peninsula after a referendum the West calls illegitimate. The American public is tired of war; yet Europe expects leadership.

- @crimea_sanctions: Support strong sanctions and aid
- @crimea_restraint: Emphasize restraint

@crimea_sanctions
on-arrival: intl_relation += 6; moderate_strength += 2; progressive_dissent += 2

We back coordinated sanctions and aid to Kyiv. Allies are reassured.

@crimea_restraint
on-arrival: progressive_strength += 2; intl_relation -= 3; moderate_dissent += 3; populist_strength += 1

We caution against escalation. Some call it appeasement; others call it prudence.
